OL,3,AWarrants used to search Andrew's homes
OL,4,Awere unlawful, court says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police has accepted
OL,7,Fwarrants it used to search Andrew
OL,8,FMountbatten-Windsor's homes at the time
OL,9,Fof his arrest in February were
OL,10,Funlawful, the High Court has been told.
OL,12,FFollowing Thursday's hearing, items
OL,13,Fseized in the raid continue to be held
OL,14,Fby the police, with a further hearing
OL,15,Fto take place in 2027 to decide whether
OL,16,Fthe material can be used as evidence.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, the criminal investigation
OL,19,Finto Mountbatten-Windsor is ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
