OL,3,AThree sisters who drowned in sea off
OL,4,ABrighton took own lives, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree sisters who drowned in the sea
OL,7,Foff Brighton took their own lives, a
OL,8,Fcoroner has ruled.
OL,10,FJane Adetoro, 36, Christina Walters,
OL,11,F32, and Rebecca Walters, 31, had been
OL,12,Fliving "very secluded lives" following
OL,13,Fthe death of their mother, who drowned
OL,14,Fin 2010, senior coroner Penelope
OL,15,FSchofield said.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
