OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AVenezuela's ex-leader Nicolas Maduro
OL,4,Acharged with conspiracy to commit
OL,5,Atorture
OL,6,
OL,7,FMaduro, 63, and Flores, 69, have been
OL,8,Fin custody since January in a detention
OL,9,Fcentre in Brooklyn, where they were
OL,10,Ftaken after US forces seized them in a
OL,11,Fpre-dawn raid on their compound in the
OL,12,FVenezuelan capital, Caracas.
OL,14,FBarry J Pollack, Maduro's attorney,
OL,15,Fsaid his client denies the new charges
OL,16,Fand looks forward to his day in court.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
